{"seq":2,"slug":"vector-behavior-recall","title":"行为向量与 embedding 召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-recommendation-engineering/multi-recall/vector-behavior-recall","wordCount":3131,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"行为向量与-embedding-召回\">行为向量与 embedding 召回</h1><p>协同过滤把用户和商品困在同一个稀疏矩阵里：一个用户想跟另一个用户算相似度，必须恰好交互过同一个商品。这个约束在电商的稀疏密度下几乎等于「大部分用户找不到相似用户」。双塔模型（two-tower）把这个问题换了个提法：不再要求用户与商品在同一张共现表里相遇，而是让用户和商品各自被编码成稠密向量，在同一个向量空间里比较距离。这一步把「共现统计」升级为「表示学习」，也把召回从一个数学问题变成了一个系统工程问题——因为向量的近邻检索不是精确计算能承受的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-双塔结构与点积检索\">核心概念：双塔结构与点积检索</h2><p>双塔模型有两个独立的编码器，分别处理用户侧和商品侧的特征。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 用户塔 user tower&#10;        UF[用户特征&lt;br/&gt;画像/上下文/行为序列] --&gt; UE[Encoder]&#10;        UE --&gt; UV[用户向量 u]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 商品塔 item tower&#10;        IF[商品特征&lt;br/&gt;类目/品牌/标题/图像] --&gt; IE[Encoder]&#10;        IE --&gt; IV[商品向量 v]&#10;    end&#10;    UV --&gt; D[内积 / 余弦]&#10;    IV --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; S[&quot;score(u,i) = u · v&quot;]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 用户塔 user tower\n        UF[用户特征&lt;br/&gt;画像/上下文/行为序列] --&gt; UE[Encoder]\n        UE --&gt; UV[用户向量 u]\n    end\n    subgraph 商品塔 item tower\n        IF[商品特征&lt;br/&gt;类目/品牌/标题/图像] --&gt; IE[Encoder]\n        IE --&gt; IV[商品向量 v]\n    end\n    UV --&gt; D[内积 / 余弦]\n    IV --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; S[\"score(u,i) = u · v\"]</pre><p>两塔在训练时联合优化，在服务时<strong>完全解耦</strong>：商品塔离线跑一遍，把全量商品编码成向量写进向量索引；用户塔在请求时在线跑一次，得到一个查询向量，然后用近似近邻（ANN）检索在索引里找最接近的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个商品。解耦是双塔的核心工程价值所在——它把一个需要「用户 × 商品」全组合计算的问题，变成了「一次用户编码 + 一次近邻检索」。</p>\n<p>打分函数通常就是内积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>D</mi></munderover><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(u, i) = \\langle \\mathbf{u}, \\mathbf{v}_i \\rangle = \\sum_{d=1}^{D} u_d \\, v_{i,d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若两塔输出都做 L2 归一化，内积退化为余弦相似度。归一化的取舍是个工程决策：归一化让分数有界、训练更稳，但丢失了向量模长可能携带的「活跃度/热度」信息；不归一化则分数尺度随训练漂移，跨路对比困难。工业界主流做法是<strong>归一化并显式提高热度特征在商品塔中的权重</strong>，把热度建模为一个特征而不是把模长当作热度的代理变量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>协同过滤</th>\n<th>双塔 embedding 召回</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>表示形式</td>\n<td>稀疏交互矩阵</td>\n<td>稠密向量（通常 32-256 维）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否用内容特征</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（标题文本、图像、类目）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动能力</td>\n<td>无（无交互即无表示）</td>\n<td>有（内容特征可编码）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛化能力</td>\n<td>弱（只覆盖有共现的对）</td>\n<td>强（向量空间连续）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练数据需求</td>\n<td>共现统计</td>\n<td>正负样本对 + 负采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务形式</td>\n<td>相似度表查找</td>\n<td>ANN 索引检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>中（「买过 X 的人也买」）</td>\n<td>低（向量维度无语义）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新成本</td>\n<td>全量重算相似度</td>\n<td>商品塔重推理 + 索引重建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"训练目标与负采样\">训练目标与负采样</h2><p>双塔的训练本质是在做<strong>对比学习</strong>：让用户向量靠近他真实交互过的商品、远离他没有交互的商品。最常用的损失是带 in-batch 负样本的 softmax（即 sampled softmax，TensorFlow 的实现见 <a href=\"https://www.tensorflow.org/api_docs/python/tf/nn/sampled_softmax_loss；工业级双塔的采样偏差校正与流式训练见\">https://www.tensorflow.org/api_docs/python/tf/nn/sampled_softmax_loss；工业级双塔的采样偏差校正与流式训练见</a> Covington 等, <em>Deep Neural Networks for YouTube Recommendations</em>, RecSys 2016, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/2959100.2959190）：\">https://doi.org/10.1145/2959100.2959190）：</a></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow></munder><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = -\\sum_{(u,i^+) \\in \\mathcal{D}} \\log \\frac{\\exp(\\langle \\mathbf{u}, \\mathbf{v}_{i^+}\\rangle / \\tau)}{\\exp(\\langle \\mathbf{u}, \\mathbf{v}_{i^+}\\rangle / \\tau) + \\sum_{i^- \\in \\mathcal{N}(u)} \\exp(\\langle \\mathbf{u}, \\mathbf{v}_{i^-}\\rangle / \\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.943em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7027em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3419em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7027em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7027em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4747em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3419em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7027em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3419em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7027em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1607em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是温度参数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{N}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是负样本集合。这个损失函数形式上是多分类交叉熵，语义是「在候选集合中把用户真正交互过的商品识别出来」。温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制分布的尖锐程度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 小则模型更关注最难的负样本，训练更激进也更容易不稳定；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 大则梯度更平滑。这个参数对召回质量影响显著，必须作为调参重点。</p>\n<p>负采样的分布选择比损失函数选择更容易出错，三种负样本各有用途。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>负样本类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机负样本</td>\n<td>全库随机抽取</td>\n<td>提供全局区分度，成本低</td>\n<td>太容易，梯度贡献小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>in-batch 负样本</td>\n<td>同批内其他样本的正例</td>\n<td>零额外成本，效果好</td>\n<td>热门商品被过度惩罚（被当作负样本次数多）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曝光未点击负样本</td>\n<td>与正例同次请求的未点击商品</td>\n<td>难度高，贴近线上分布</td>\n<td>含位置偏差，会把位置效应学进向量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>难负样本挖掘</td>\n<td>当前模型打分高但未交互</td>\n<td>提升边界区分度</td>\n<td>挖掘偏差会放大假负例（用户其实想要但没看到）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三种（曝光未点击）是最贴近线上分布的负样本，但它带着位置偏差——排在第 20 位没被点，可能不是因为不喜欢而是因为没被看到。把它当负例训练，模型学到的向量会把「排在后面的商品」推远。处理方式与第一章第一篇讲的位置偏差一致：给曝光未点击的负样本按位置调整权重，或者用「位置随机化」的线上实验数据来采集无偏负样本。</p>\n<p>第四种难负样本挖掘有一个已知陷阱：被挖掘出的「高分未交互」商品里混有<strong>假负例</strong>——用户其实会喜欢但那一次没被展示或没被看到。用假负例训练会让模型把真实的兴趣推远，表现为线上召回多样性下降。缓解手段是给挖掘出的负样本加一个小于 1 的权重，或只在训练后期才启用难负样本（课程学习思路）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ann-检索-把点积变成可服务的操作\">ANN 检索：把点积变成可服务的操作</h2><p>商品向量数量在亿级时，逐条计算内积不可行（单次请求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 维浮点乘加，即使向量化也要数十毫秒以上，且无法随流量水平扩展）。ANN 检索用一点精度换取数量级的加速。工业主流是两类：</p>\n<p><strong>基于近邻图的方法（HNSW 为代表）。</strong> 构造一个多层可导航小世界图，检索时从顶层随机入口逐层贪心下降到最近邻。HNSW（Malkov &amp; Yashunin, <em>Efficient and robust approximate nearest neighbor search using Hierarchical Navigable Small World graphs</em>, IEEE TPAMI 2020, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/TPAMI.2018.2889473；开源实现见\">https://doi.org/10.1109/TPAMI.2018.2889473；开源实现见</a> hnswlib, <a href=\"https://github.com/nmslib/hnswlib）在召回率与延迟上表现优异，缺点是**内存占用大**（图结构加向量本身，亿级向量通常需要数百\">https://github.com/nmslib/hnswlib）在召回率与延迟上表现优异，缺点是**内存占用大**（图结构加向量本身，亿级向量通常需要数百</a> GB 内存，必须分片）且<strong>不支持增量删除友好</strong>（删除需要打标记并周期性重建）。</p>\n<p><strong>基于量化/倒排的方法（IVF-PQ 为代表）。</strong> 先用 k-means 把向量空间划成若干簇（倒排列表），检索时只探查最近的若干簇；再用乘积量化（PQ）把向量压缩成短码，用查表代替浮点乘法（乘积量化见 Jégou 等, <em>Product Quantization for Nearest Neighbor Search</em>, IEEE TPAMI 2011, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/TPAMI.2010.57）。IVF-PQ\">https://doi.org/10.1109/TPAMI.2010.57）。IVF-PQ</a> 的内存占用远低于 HNSW（可压缩 10-30 倍），适合超大规模，代价是召回率略低且需要调 <code>nprobe</code>（探查簇数）在延迟与召回之间权衡（索引选型与内存/召回权衡的官方指南见 FAISS Wiki, <a href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss/wiki/Guidelines-to-choose-an-index）。\">https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss/wiki/Guidelines-to-choose-an-index）。</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>HNSW</th>\n<th>IVF-PQ</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>高（向量 + 图）</td>\n<td>低（量化码）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索延迟</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低（取决于 nprobe）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>召回率</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中高（可调）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量插入</td>\n<td>友好</td>\n<td>需要定期重训量化器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>需打标记 + 重建</td>\n<td>需打标记 + 重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>千万至亿级（分片）</td>\n<td>亿至百亿级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论哪种，<strong>索引重建与增量更新的治理</strong>都是生产事故高发区。商品下架后若索引未更新，ANN 仍会返回该商品的向量，因此召回结果必须经过一层<strong>可售性过滤</strong>（见第一章第三篇的融合过滤步骤与第四章第一篇的新品扶持配额）。索引更新周期与商品上下架频率必须匹配：高频上下架的市场（时尚、生鲜）需要更短的索引更新周期，或者把可售性过滤前置为索引的软删除支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户塔的输入-行为序列如何编码\">用户塔的输入：行为序列如何编码</h2><p>用户塔的输入决定了召回质量的上限。最朴素的输入是用户 ID 嵌入加静态画像特征，它的致命缺陷是<strong>无法处理新用户</strong>（没有 ID 嵌入）。因此生产级用户塔一定包含行为序列编码。</p>\n<p>行为序列的编码有几种典型结构。最简单的是<strong>平均池化</strong>：把最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个交互商品的向量求平均作为用户向量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{u} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n} \\mathbf{v}_{i_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的优点是零额外参数、可解释，缺点是丢失顺序与时间间隔信息——先看 A 后看 B 与反过来得到同一个向量。改进是<strong>注意力池化</strong>（用目标商品作 query 对历史做注意力），但目标商品在召回阶段是未知的（这正是召回要解决的问题），因此实践中常用的是<strong>自注意力序列编码</strong>（SASRec 类结构）或<strong>门控循环单元</strong>（GRU4Rec 类结构），让序列自身建模转移规律（SASRec 见 Kang &amp; McAuley, ICDM 2018, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1808.09781；GRU4Rec\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1808.09781；GRU4Rec</a> 见 Hidasi 等, <em>Session-based Recommendations with Recurrent Neural Networks</em>, ICLR 2016, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1511.06939）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1511.06939）。</a></p>\n<p>时间间隔必须显式编码。用户在 5 分钟前浏览的商品与 30 天前浏览的同类商品，对当前会话的相关性完全不同。常见实现是把时间差做分桶嵌入（如「1 小时内 / 1 天内 / 1 周内 / 更早」）后拼进商品向量，或对序列位置做指数衰减加权。这个设计与第一章第一篇给出的时间衰减权重重合，区别只是此处衰减作用在表示上而非标签权重上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程契约-召回分数归一化与路标识\">工程契约：召回分数归一化与路标识</h2><p>双塔召回的输出不是最终列表，而是候选池的一部分。因此它必须遵守第二章开篇声明的召回层契约：<strong>输出项携带路标识（source tag）与归一化分数</strong>。</p>\n<p>归一化是必须的，因为内积分数的绝对尺度取决于训练时的温度、向量维度与负采样规模，与其他召回路径的输出完全不可比。工程上有两种归一化：全局 min-max（在当次请求的所有候选上算）与 rank-based（按分数排名映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>）。前者保留了分差信息但受异常值影响，后者鲁棒但丢失分差。粗排模型需要分差信息来学习如何信任这一路，因此推荐使用带截断的 min-max（把分布两端 1% 以外的值截断后再归一化）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function twoTowerRecall(userId, context, N, sources):&#10;  u = userTower.encode(populateFeatures(userId, context))&#10;  candidates = []&#10;  for source in sources:&#10;    hits = annIndex[source].search(u, k=N * oversample)&#10;    for hit in hits:&#10;      if not sellable(hit.docId): continue&#10;      candidates.append({docId, score: hit.score, source: source.tag})&#10;  return normalizePerSource(dedupe(candidates))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function twoTowerRecall(userId, context, N, sources):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  u = userTower.encode(populateFeatures(userId, context))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  candidates = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for source in sources:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hits = annIndex[source].search(u, k=N * oversample)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for hit in hits:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if not sellable(hit.docId): continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      candidates.append({docId, score: hit.score, source: source.tag})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return normalizePerSource(dedupe(candidates))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>oversample</code> 的用途是补偿可售性过滤与去重带来的损耗——若不超采样，过滤后的候选数会低于目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。超采样比例必须根据实际过滤率动态调整，固定值在商品下架潮（大促结束、季节性清仓）时会不足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>双塔把用户与商品编码到同一稠密空间，用内积打分；训练时联合优化、服务时解耦（商品塔离线、用户塔在线 + ANN 检索）。</li>\n<li>对比学习损失（sampled softmax）配温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>；负样本分四类，in-batch 零成本但惩罚热门，曝光未点击贴近线上但带位置偏差，难负样本提升边界但混有假负例。</li>\n<li>ANN 检索在 HNSW（高内存、低延迟、高召回）与 IVF-PQ（低内存、可调召回）之间选择；两者都必须配套增量更新与可售性过滤的治理。</li>\n<li>用户塔必须包含行为序列编码（平均 / 自注意力 / 循环），且显式编码时间间隔，否则新用户无法表示。</li>\n<li>召回输出必须带路标识并做按路归一化，超采样比例需随过滤率动态调整。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关内容：协同过滤是双塔的前身与对照，见 <a href=\"cf-item-user\">协同过滤：user-based/item-based</a>；非模型的兜底召回从另一侧补足覆盖，见 <a href=\"rule-hot-new-recall\">热门/新品/运营规则召回兜底</a>；双塔的离线训练与在线一致性风险见 <a href=\"../ranking-diversity/coarse-fine-rank\">推荐粗排与精排模型</a>；新品没有交互数据时的内容编码路径见 <a href=\"../coldstart-serving/user-item-coldstart\">用户冷启动与新品扶持</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"行为向量与 embedding 召回","id":"行为向量与-embedding-召回"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：双塔结构与点积检索","id":"核心概念-双塔结构与点积检索"},{"level":2,"text":"训练目标与负采样","id":"训练目标与负采样"},{"level":2,"text":"ANN 检索：把点积变成可服务的操作","id":"ann-检索-把点积变成可服务的操作"},{"level":2,"text":"用户塔的输入：行为序列如何编码","id":"用户塔的输入-行为序列如何编码"},{"level":2,"text":"工程契约：召回分数归一化与路标识","id":"工程契约-召回分数归一化与路标识"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协同过滤：user-based/item-based","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-recommendation-engineering/multi-recall/cf-item-user"},"next":{"title":"热门/新品/运营规则召回兜底","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-recommendation-engineering/multi-recall/rule-hot-new-recall"}}